/* Odin dev-2026-07 emits -lpthread for Linux-subtarget Android builds.
 * Android's pthread API is part of Bionic libc and NDK r28c intentionally
 * ships no standalone libpthread. Keep this linker-only compatibility shim
 * ahead of the NDK search path; no libpthread dependency may reach an APK.
 */
INPUT(-lc)
